    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superbly located 4 bedroom detached bungalow extending to c.204 sq.m (c.2,195 sq.ft) and situated on an elevated site with fantastic views. Located close to the village of Ardee and situated in open countryside, yet within 10 minutes of the M1 Motorway giving access to Dublin & Belfast, this is a rare opportunity to acquire a large detached family home offering well-proportioned and flexible living space. The property offers a large kitchen/dining and TV room and separate livingroom, utility and main bathroom (needs to be completed) three double bedrooms (master en-suite) and one single, with the benefit of a detached garage set amongst c. 0.75 acre of gardens to front, side and rear with views over adjacent farmland. With easy access to Ardee Town within 15 minute’s drive, this is a great home ideal for any purchaser who is seeking a large but manageable  property in good condition."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "4 Bedroom Detached Property\r\nBuilt C. 2003\r\nC. 0.45                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               \r\nExtends to C. 200 sq.m. (2,152 sq.ft.)\r\nO-F-C-H- Boiler\r\nOpen Fire x Stove \r\nDetached Garage 42 sq.m (452 sq.ft) \r\nFenced Boundary\r\nFully Alarmed\r\nBio-Cycle\r\nWell water"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C"
      }
    ],
